+## Constraints
+
+- Domain layer only: `pharma_agent.domain.corpus.authoring` imports nothing outside
+  `pharma_agent.domain` and the standard library / pydantic; no I/O.
+- Existing modules (`bundle.py`, `models.py`, `source.py`, import service) do not change.
+- Output is deterministic: no clocks, randomness or set/dict-order dependence.
+- Reuse `BlockRecord`, `SectionRecord`, `DocumentRecord`, `KnowledgeBundle` as they are;
+  bundles produced must pass `write_bundle` validation.
+- Each task is test-first (see the test fail, then make it pass); ruff-clean code.
+
